    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38055" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπανα-δίπλωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>doubling, folding,</i> of the intestines, ib.<i><span class="en">
				507b30
			</span></i> (pl.); of the spermatic glands, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				717a33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δέρματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Leonid.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>repetition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APr.</u>
				49a26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναστροφή</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Tib.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Medic.,
				<i>'reduplication',</i> i.e. <i>combination</i> of two kinds
			of fevers, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.433
			</span></i>.</div>
